items.block:
Its object is non-existence;
Its sovereign is held to be mindfulness;
Its aspect is peace itself.

items.graded_text:
Its object is non-existence;
Its sovereign is held to be mindfulness;
Its aspect is peace itself.

items.block:
It is also said in the glorious <term>Manjushri-nama-samgiti</term> <gloss>Chanting the Names of Manjushri</gloss>:
The single eye of wisdom, stainless;
The <term>Tathagata</term> who possesses the body of primordial wisdom.

